2026-07-27T09:23:47.3760815Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T09:23:47.3761308Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T09:23:47.3761689Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T09:23:47.3762244Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T09:23:47.3763071Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T09:23:47.3764007Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
